 <h3><u>Ya fatima rida mein chupa lo hussain ko</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Ya ghareeb ya hussain<br> haye ghareeb, haye hussain<br> haaye.. arey<br> maqtal mein gir raha hai..(2)<br> sambhalo hussain ko<br> ya fatima rida mein chupa lo hussain ko..(3)</p> 
  <p>maqtal mein gir raha hai..(2)<br> sambhalo hussain ko<br> ya fatima rida mein chupa lo hussain ko..(3)</p> 
  <p>1. Paiwast hai ghareeb ke pehlu mein barchiya'n<br> tumko bhi uthne deti nahi tooti pasliya'n<br> lekar ali ka naam..(2)<br> utha lo hussain ko<br> ya fatima rida mein chupa lo hussain ko..(2)</p> 
  <p>2. Deewar o darr ke&nbsp; beech jo armaan reh gaye<br> rakhi hui thi dil mein jo mohsin ke waaste<br> wo loriya'n bhi aaj..(2)<br> suna lo hussain ko<br> ya fatima rida mein chupa lo hussain ko..(2)</p> 
  <p>3. Sola pehere ki pyaas hai aur hai labo pe dumm<br> dekar ghareeb bete ko abbas ki qasam<br> paani agar mile to..(2)<br> pila lo hussain ko<br> ya fatima rida mein chupa lo hussain ko..(2)</p> 
  <p>4. Sheh ki ghareeb beti ke armaan ki tarha<br> godi mein leke teesri shabaan ki tarha<br> kuch der ho sake to..(2)<br> sula lo hussain ko<br> ya fatima rida mein chupa lo hussain ko..(2)</p> 
  <p>5. Haider tadap rahe hai payambar hai beqaraar<br> tum kaise sun rahi ho sadaein ye baar baar<br> ek shor hai zamee'n par..(2)<br> gira lo hussain ko<br> ya fatima rida mein chupa lo hussain ko..(2)</p> 
  <p>6. Ache nahi irade yazidi sipaah ke<br> pao'n nikal rahe hai rakabo se shaah ke<br> ghazi nahi hai tum hi..(2)<br> sambhalo hussain ko<br> ya fatima rida mein chupa lo hussain ko..(2)</p> 
  <p>7. Zainab sada ye deti hai aye beqaraar maa<br> zakhmo ko milke baandhegi haider ki betiya'n<br> khaime mein ek baar..(2)<br> bulalo hussain ko<br> ya fatima rida mein chupa lo hussain ko..(2)</p> 
  <p>8. Rone lagi aye mir takallum wo ghum zada<br> phailake apne haath jo shabbir ne kaha<br> haye godi mein thodi der..(2)<br> sulalo hussain ko<br> ya fatima rida mein chupa lo hussain ko..(2)</p> 
